  <data name="ScamAiUnavailable" xml:space="preserve"><value>No explanation from the AI (Ollama is not running, the model is missing or it took too long). Use the result above.</value></data>
  <data name="SettingsOllama" xml:space="preserve"><value>Local AI (Ollama)</value></data>
  <data name="SettingsOllamaDescription" xml:space="preserve"><value>When on, the "Is this a scam?" button sends the page text to Ollama running on your own computer and shows a plain Bangla explanation. The text does not go to the internet or anywhere else. Ollama must be installed separately. When off or not found, only the rule based result is shown.</value></data>
